#section[Professional Summary]

*Backend Engineer* with *6 years of software development experience* building scalable, reliable, and high-performance applications. Strong expertise in *NestJS*, *PostgreSQL*, *MongoDB*, and *Redis*, complemented by hands-on experience with *microservices*, *message queues*, and *Docker*. Experienced in *API performance optimization*, *application security*, and designing reliable backend systems with efficient data processing and asynchronous communication.


